 YesOrNoWithLongQuestion;globalParms;msg;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button together with a long message.
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 msg←'I have to make sure that you are really really certain about your decision, therefore please confirm:'
 ⎕←globalParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo msg
